* ==============================================================================

/*
This replication package was developed using Stata 18.5 and tested on Windows 11.

## Data requirements

The following datasets cannot be redistributed with this repository:

* Townsend Thai annual household survey
* Townsend Thai key informant survey
* 2000 SES data
* Gross provincial product (GPP) data

The Townsend Thai annual household survey and Townsend Thai key informant survey
can be obtained from:
https://townsend-thai.mit.edu/about/

The 2000 SES data can be obtained from the Thai National Statistical Office.

The GPP data is distributed with the repository: data/99external_GPP_long.dta

Users must obtain these datasets separately and specify their file locations
in `00_master.do`.

The 2000 SES data are used only to produce summary statistics and calculate
the EEG measure. They are therefore not required to replicate the main
analysis.

## Replication procedure

1. Obtain the required external datasets.
2. Specify the data locations in `00_master.do`.
3. Run `00_master.do`.
4. Tables and figures will be saved in the `out/` directory.

## Directory structure

- `do/` — Stata do-files
- `data/` — intermediate data
- `out/` — tables and figures generated by the analysis
- `log/` — Stata log files
*/


